# Introduction

Aesir provides components for Svelte 5 and Custom Elements for other frameworks or plain HTML.

<DocsTable columns={distributionColumns} rows={distributionRows} minWidth="var(--ds-sizing-xl)" />

Start with [Installation](/docs/installation/). See [Theming](/docs/theming/) for modes and accent colors, or [Design tokens](/docs/design-tokens/) to change the system.

## What you get

- Semantic color tokens with light and dark values.
- Shared typography, spacing, sizing, radius, grid, opacity, filter, and motion scales.
- Accessible Svelte components with native keyboard and form behavior.
- Framework-independent Custom Elements for plain HTML applications.
- Generated Figma and Penpot token files.
- Documentation previews backed by the same component source shown in each code example.

Explore [foundations](/docs/colors/) for the shared scales and [components](/docs/button/) for examples and APIs.
